#==============================================================================================
#
#   html_selected_content_element - HTML::HTMLSelectedContentElement: <selectedcontent>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/HTML/HTMLSelectedContentElement.cpp (lines 1-112) and the inline
#       functions of HTMLSelectedContentElement.h: construction (which moves the mixin tables
#       to HTMLSelectedContentElement's, as C++'s vptrs move), clearing, the disabled state,
#       and the post-connection and removing steps that keep the nearest select's
#       selectedcontent up to date.
